This repository contains all the default color configurations, for use with
OpenColorIO.

Visit opencolorio.org for additional information.

Other sources for OpenColorIO Configs (including ACES and SPI configs):
- https://github.com/imageworks/OpenColorIO-Configs
- https://github.com/hpd/OpenColorIO-Configs
- https://github.com/colour-science/OpenColorIO-Configs
- https://github.com/shridhar2011/OpenColorIO-ACES_1.2
- https://github.com/sobotka/ocio-blender-default
- https://github.com/sobotka/filmic-blender
